{"id":"14209f87e5536e32","group":"91","path":"91/91-fact-truth-theory-applications.md","title":"fact-truth-theory-applications — 真理理论的两类形式应用","display":"fact-truth-theory-applications — 真理理论的两类形式应用","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-fact-truth-theory-applications","aliases":["91-fact-truth-theory-applications","91-fact-truth-applications","91-fact-theory-uses"],"display":"fact-truth-theory-applications — 真理理论的两类形式应用","depends_on":["[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-fact-truth-theory-applications"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-fact-truth-theory-applications</span><span>91-fact-truth-applications</span><span>91-fact-theory-uses</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-truth-theory-applications — 真理理论的两类形式应用"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" href=\"?note=0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" title=\"91-thm-fixed-point-existence\">91-thm-fixed-point-existence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (可递归公理化的对象理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\\)</span> (对象理论的可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}(x)\\)</span> (对象理论句子的编码谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\bot\">\\(T,\\bot\\)</span> (真理谓词与固定矛盾句)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:L\\to L\">\\(J:L\\to L\\)</span> (真理跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (完备格断言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}applications}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\forall x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\n\\to T(x)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}applications}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\forall x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\n\\to T(x)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式概括证明论应用：若对象理论的每个证明都保持真，并且矛盾不真，\n则对象理论一致。标准 KF 对 PA 的一致性证明正利用这种反思机制。</p>\n<p>第二式概括语义应用：把真理条件组织成完备格上的单调跳跃，就能用\nKnaster–Tarski 定理获得固定点，并比较极小、极大及其他固定点中的\n悖论句行为。具体程序验证、类型系统或自然语言应用需要额外的翻译定理，\n不能仅从“使用真理谓词”自动推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence","status":"resolved","id":"0caf6a4fb6071bd3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"J:L\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}applications}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\forall x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\n\\to T(x)\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathcal S}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":2236,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-truth-theory-applications]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-truth-theory-applications]]"}],"outgoing":["fa1e29f5683a4d6f","16b107dfee99998b","4e50c115b0d32044","0caf6a4fb6071bd3"]}